/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPARRY_GITHYANKI%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CPARRY_GITHYANKI%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Ready_to_Parry\">Sources of Ready to Parry</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Githyanki Parry\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/30px-Parry_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/45px-Parry_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/60px-Parry_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Githyanki Parry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp/30px-Parry_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Parry_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki_Parry\" title=\"Githyanki Parry\">Githyanki Parry</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Ready_to_Parry\">Creatures with Ready to Parry</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png/30px-Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png/45px-Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png/60px-Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baretha\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png/30px-Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Sarth_Baretha.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Baretha\" title=\"Baretha\">Baretha</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Har%27rak.png/30px-Portrait_Har%27rak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Har%27rak.png/45px-Portrait_Har%27rak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Har%27rak.png/60px-Portrait_Har%27rak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Har'rak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Portrait_Har%27rak.png/30px-Portrait_Har%27rak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Portrait_Har%27rak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Har%27rak\" title=\"Har'rak\">Har'rak</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>PARRY_GITHYANKI</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Ready_to_Parry\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ready_to_Parry_(Condition)\" title=\"Ready to Parry (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ready to Parry\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Parry_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Parry_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ready to Parry</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a> stands ready to parry the next weapon attack, reducing its incoming damage by 10.</li>\n<li>The Githyanki can parry an attack as long as they have a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>, they wield a <a href=\"/wiki/Greatswords\" title=\"Greatswords\">greatsword</a>, and they aren't <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Incapacitate